{"summary":"Solve the mystery behind the distortion of your house in this wholesome quest","description":"Night Reverie is a Puzzle/Adventure game in which a child must solve the mystery behind the distortion of his house. Enjoy a variety of dream-like environments and discover the truth behind the distortion of the house. There must be an answer to all of this and a way to return things back to normal.\n\n- Explore a house filled with unique environments only seen in dreams\n-Interact with a unique cast of characters and engage in conversations to discover more about the world\n- Collect, combine and use a variety of items to solve the mystery of the house\n-Solve an array of both challenging and intuitive puzzles in order to get closer to the truth\n-Dive into a detailed and colorful world designed and made pixel by pixel\n-Listen to an engaging original soundtrack that immerses you into the world of Night Reverie","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood, Mild Language","pegiNotes":"Fear, Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EPGic9hpsZU?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fhqcqUAeABuvuLKyJ2MDFQKHsts_sWjiOXSqVOvCF4GxVrMKWqnwqfduLJ39ENxIo7-v6ktnSQofWcZrYoivJuU","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GZ9GcgMEqFjEw6hBzW_s_UH3n2Bogc-151tIDBLrL2xzx7OlVxOJOH8RmL9RzV1Vx64j4DcBf7Qs3drFI6m-","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5sMYV8s133pfdR-87im7-EGMdZ8PoKPIsxTgcIwuXoHB55iumZc8dfgwFSyeu9nSlm-cZFUJym0NZr7iwzFfnOQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vh4x8CgHRk12A5VX9jPUgoTonfimafF0Yl1HtIWYeFvYJsGljiAHDjPiCjykr9Js4TZdqTxqbkX2dW8S3KtgsQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NWdQWi6DigtUvM-_16J_yBfHDPD6l2dGO0XrideoJNMqrHcYjmtOb4j_S_hxd94OaYRSlRcqin17CgG5mAobmw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ksGTwOlu-0Hy7e9-PJ5LvJPLX045AppTF0dQqDWRgAqSSTTDYAKsP6bXfZ_9bIKOwa1usuwmRL3qD62h-ZA3","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SZVId5TojEwNHXVjI5VSqwF4DSsTTbNgpkvRpxtCNNzDLKy7